{"id": "bart-airport-connector-stimulus-redirect", "title": "Why Oakland’s airport train lost a $70 million stimulus grant", "seconds": 59.5, "voice": "elevenlabs:OUMCzFUTd0F4Q6lkLkco", "narrator": "Roxy", "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "83adafe3c18afe47", "words": 144, "beats": [{"scene": "p", "kind": "hook", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "Where did the airport train’s $70 million grant go?", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 4.04, "shot": "s0", "visual": {"type": "hook", "words": ["Where", "the grant", "went"], "sub": "Oakland Airport Connector"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.34, 0.43, 0.86, 1.28, 1.66, 1.99, 2.38, 2.71]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "A 2009 complaint identified the missing service equity analysis. Federal reviewers agreed.", "t0": 4.04, "t1": 10.41, "shot": "s1", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Service equity analysis"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.21, 0.45, 0.88, 1.14, 1.71, 2.34, 2.43, 2.86, 3.31, 3.71, 5.0, 5.4, 5.87]}, {"scene": "p", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]"], "text": "On February 12, 2010, the federal administrator rejected BART’s plan to fix it.", "t0": 10.53, "t1": 16.42, "shot": "s2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rejection", "kicker": "Federal Transit Administration", "text": "your plan is rejected", "mark": "rejected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.69, 1.31, 1.81, 2.61, 2.78, 3.15, 3.83, 4.4, 4.8, 5.16, 5.29, 5.64]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[1]", "suspicious[1]"], "text": "On February 17, the region redirected $70 million to other Bay Area transit projects.", "t0": 16.64, "t1": 22.88, "shot": "s3", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$70 million", "label": "Regional stimulus funds redirected"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.66, 1.41, 1.58, 1.95, 2.65, 3.11, 3.52, 3.97, 4.11, 4.4, 4.67, 5.03, 5.49]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "Muni received more than $17 million for rail repairs and preventive maintenance.", "t0": 23.0, "t1": 27.86, "shot": "s4", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$17.46 million", "label": "Muni light-rail trucks and preventive maintenance"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.36, 0.73, 0.85, 1.04, 1.61, 1.98, 2.39, 2.58, 2.87, 3.42, 3.59, 4.16]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[1]"], "text": "BART kept almost $17 million for other capital work. Caltrain got money for bridges.", "t0": 27.98, "t1": 34.4, "shot": "s5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$16,972,051", "label": "Separate BART projects"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.4, 0.67, 0.96, 1.51, 1.88, 2.29, 2.46, 2.73, 3.2, 4.25, 5.01, 5.26, 5.55, 5.74]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]"], "text": "On July 22, BART’s board cut $8 million from the airport project and approved replacement funding.", "t0": 34.52, "t1": 40.87, "shot": "s6", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$8 million", "label": "Project cost reductions"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.57, 1.46, 1.83, 2.15, 2.42, 2.66, 3.04, 3.41, 3.55, 3.64, 4.07, 4.65, 4.77, 5.21, 5.81]}, {"scene": "b", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The revised plan drew on state money, reserves and proposed borrowing.", "t0": 40.99, "t1": 45.6, "shot": "s7", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "July 2010 funding plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.13, 0.66, 1.09, 1.38, 1.56, 1.95, 2.56, 3.23, 3.43, 3.98]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "In March 2011, the federal government allocated almost $25 million under a separate transit program.", "t0": 45.82, "t1": 52.57, "shot": "s8", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$24,999,999", "label": "Federal New Starts allocation"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.57, 0.94, 1.47, 1.62, 2.0, 2.45, 2.99, 3.3, 4.03, 4.44, 4.93, 5.18, 5.26, 5.65, 6.12]}, {"scene": "o", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "BART opened the airport line in November 2014.", "t0": 52.69, "t1": 55.91, "shot": "s9", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "November 22, 2014"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.38, 0.7, 0.82, 1.29, 1.62, 